OL,5,G1830 How Emily...
OL,6,     FAn uplifting exploration of life
OL,7,     Ffor Emily Nicole Roberts, a
OL,8,     Fwheelchair user with cerebral
OL,9,     Fpalsy. In this episode, Emily
OL,10,     Flooks at the world of beauty and
OL,11,     Ffashion for those with a
OL,12,     Fdisability.
OL,13,G1900 Huw Stephens
OL,14,     FHuw Stephens plays classic tracks,
OL,15,     Fintroduces his Artist of the Week
OL,16,     Fand features new music from Wales
OL,17,     Fand beyond.
OL,18,G2200 Lois Cernyw
OL,19,     FLois brightens your night-time
OL,20,     Fwith great music and chat. Call
OL,21,     F03700 100 110 Text 81012 or via X
OL,22,     F@bbcradiowales.
